<c:set var="pageTitle" value="Help"/><%@ include file="includes/header.jspf" %><h1>Staff Help</h1><ol class="card"><li>Sign in using an authorized staff account.</li><li>Choose New Appointment and enter validated patient details.</li><li>Select a dentist and treatment, then choose a future date and time.</li><li>The system checks treatment duration and prevents overlapping bookings.</li><li>Use Appointments to search by number, patient, date or status.</li><li>Open an appointment to progress its workflow.</li><li>Issue and print the bill after confirming fees and discount.</li><li>Always use Logout when leaving the workstation.</li></ol><%@ include file="includes/footer.jspf" %>